  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.17 - AM041 chained CreateMap fixer safety\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM041 so duplicate `CreateMap<TSource, TDestination>()` registrations carrying chained `ForMember`, `ForPath`, or other configuration (including parenthesized chains and chains beyond `.ReverseMap()`) no longer offer an automatic removal that would silently drop mapping policy\n            - The bare `CreateMap<TSource, TDestination>().ReverseMap()` reversal path remains safe and still gets the automatic swap\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM041 and RuleCatalog coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.16 - Analyzer precision hardening",
